],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjpyKH5s9eWAxVCka8BHXioDhMQ3IcHCFkoDQ",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["千代姬拉麵專門店（台北京站門市）\n\n地理位置: 靠近 台北車站京站一樓外圍，不要在室內狂找會找不到\n\n菜色: 老實說不知道是我的味覺與別人不同或是其他可能，總之湯汁實在太鹹了鹹到我有一度想要拿冰開水放進去湯汁中中和一下味道，不然這些麵我可能吃不完舌頭有點無法接受這樣高鹽的湯，不然我還真的想品味一下雞白湯的味道，另外麵體的部分有點接近濃稠並且麵心有一點接近沒熟透的FU，我確定這不是我喜歡的口感，但不確定是不是別人愛的，因為我當下看到別桌的人吃的津津有味，所以我不確定只能說這是我個人觀感。整體來說我最滿意的可能是那一盤加點的甜不辣\n\n環境: 整體來說這是很乾淨的空間，小小的一個長廊設計 簡單的桌椅……沒有任何多餘的閒置空間利用到極致。\n\n服務:整體採取自助式，QR碼掃碼點餐，沒啥服務 但是出餐算快就這樣吧",null,[0,49]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9968557866310692638/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTnFOelpNUVdOUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,14845,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqNzZMQWNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xb0a76ba3ac5cad08!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICj76LAcQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqNzZMQWNREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqNzZMQWNREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2o3NkxBOFFFEhNDZ3dJaXJXenNRWVFvTHZPeVFNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2o3NkxBQ1ESE0Nnd0lpcld6c1FZUW9Mdk95UU0iEgkAAAAAAAAAABEIrVyso2unsCoLMGFBQ2U5dEJ0cVY\u0026wv\u